      "parameters": {
        "content": "## ⚡ PDF Financial Reports & Earnings Tables to Clean Markdown / JSON Extractor\n\n**What this workflow does:**\nExtract complex financial tables from PDF reports into structured Markdown and JSON for automated AI financial analysis.\n\n**Powered by Apify Actor:** [`laborious_rumor/pdf-table-financial-report-markdown-extractor`](https://apify.com/laborious_rumor/pdf-table-financial-report-markdown-extractor) (*First 1,000 results 100% Free — zero login cookies required!*)\n\n### Setup in 30 Seconds:\n1. Get your free Apify API token at [console.apify.com/settings/integrations](https://console.apify.com/settings/integrations).\n2. Open the **Run Apify PDF Financial Report & Table Extractor** HTTP Request node and replace `YOUR_APIFY_API_TOKEN` with your token.\n3. Click **Test Workflow** to extract live structured JSON records!",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 640
      },
